    "type": "question",
    "label": "30",
    "prompt": "Similarly, evaluate $\\displaystyle\\int_0^N 2xe^{-x^2}\\,dx$, and find its limit as $N\\to\\infty$.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$1-e^{-N^2}$; limit $=1$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\n\\int_0^N 2xe^{-x^2}\\,dx&=\\left[-e^{-x^2}\\right]_0^N\\\\\n&=-e^{-N^2}-(-1)\\\\\n&=1-e^{-N^2}.\n\\end{align*}$$\nAs $N\\to\\infty$, $e^{-N^2}\\to0$.\n$$\\lim_{N\\to\\infty}\\int_0^N 2xe^{-x^2}\\,dx=1.$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
